{
  "$comment": "The ONE place for the club's rules: limits, lengths and answer lists. The app reads this file directly. The database keeps the same numbers in its private.rules table: after changing a value here, run `npm run rules` to write the matching database change and test. A test fails if the two ever differ. Sodalis+ requests are sold as unlimited: plusSafetyCap is only a guard against spam, and members only see a count when they get near it. Changing an answer list also needs its label in src/lib/options.ts. pricingTest: while on is 1, every other new member starts on the free plan (no founding months) and is shown one of the three prices on the Sodalis+ page, so we can count who taps Join at each price. Set on to 0 to stop it.",
